    "summary": "Errata to the **Lord Discordant on Helstalker**. Its Move becomes 14\", its invulnerable save 4+, and its **Impaler chainglaive** becomes **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)**, melee, 5 attacks, WS 2+, Strength 8, AP -3, Damage 3.\n\n[Corrupt Machine Spirits](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.lord-discordant-on-helstalker.corrupt-machine-spirits): as your Shooting phase starts, pick 1 enemy **VEHICLE** unit **visible** to this model and no more than 12\" from it, and roll a D6:\n\n- 2-3: D3 **mortal wounds** to that unit\n- 4-5: 3 mortal wounds to that unit\n- 6: D3+3 mortal wounds to that unit\n\n[Spirit Thief](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.lord-discordant-on-helstalker.spirit-thief): as your Shooting phase starts, pick 1 enemy **VEHICLE** unit that is visible. For the rest of the phase, **Wound rolls** of 1 for attacks by friendly **HERETIC ASTARTES** models against it may be re-rolled.",
